# ─── Deliberately tracked (never add ignore rules for these) ──────────────────
#   pixi.toml, pixi.lock                     reproducible environment
#   package.json, bun.lock                   reproducible JS tooling
#   .agents/skills/, skills-lock.json        reviewed agent skills + provenance pins
#   backlog/                                 task files, versioned with the work
#   literature/literature.bib                bibliography (single source of truth)
#   literature/README.md                     corpus notes
#   literature/fulltext/                     derived paper transcripts, kept on purpose
#   thesis/                                  draft chapters + saved specifications
